# ---- MATLAB artifacts ----
*.asv
*.m~
*.autosave
*.mex*
slprj/
sccprj/
codegen/
*.slxc

# MATLAB data files. The repo ships no .mat files, and the app now stores its
# calibration presets in prefdir rather than the working directory, so anything
# matching this pattern is local state.
*.mat

# ---- Instrument output that does not belong in version control ----
# Raw sweep and acquisition exports can run to hundreds of megabytes.
*.tradb
*.pridb
*.DTA
*.csv
*.lox
cache_config.mat

# Touchstone files are NOT ignored. The four sweeps under
# examples/sample_data/ are committed on purpose so the repo runs out of the
# box. If you accumulate your own sweeps elsewhere, keep them out of the tree
# or add a targeted rule here.

# ---- Logs ----
*.log
*_Log.txt

# ---- OS files ----
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ---- Editors ----
.vscode/
.idea/
